<title>USA: Box Energy to buy back up to 4.8 pct shrs.</title>
<headline>Box Energy to buy back up to 4.8 pct shrs.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Box Energy Corp said Wednesday that its board had approved the repurchase of up to one million shares, or about 4.8 percent of its Class A and Class B common stock.</p>
<p>The company said it would make the repurchases from time to time during 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;The company feels at the current price, investment in our own stock is one of the better investment alternatives available today,&quot; a company statement said.</p>
</text>
